		    	<article>
		    		<a class="title-category" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160616054535/https://listverse.com/people-politics/politics/">Politics</a>		    		<h1>10 Arguments Against Gun Control</h1>
					<p class="meta"><span class="author"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160616054535/http://listverse.com/search/?q=FlameHorse&amp;sa=Search">FlameHorse</a></span> <time datetime="2013-12-12">December 12, 2013</time></p>





		    	<div class="ga more" id="div-gpt-ad-1358325249632-6">	
