              <div class="p-mto-pto" style="border-collapse: collapse;">


                <div style="padding: 10px 8px 0 8px;" class="newblue-candidate-position-answer-block">
                                      <div style="margin-right: 0px;text-align: justify;" class="newblue-candidate-position-answer-block">
                      &quot;I believe in the 2nd Amendment. Everybody has the right to keep and bear arms to either protect your family, protect yourselves, to be a hunter. The 2nd amendment is part of that Constitution. It&#39;s something I believe in. And, we&#39;re going to stand firm, very firm, for 2nd Amendment rights here in the state of Ohio.&quot;<br/>
                      <br/>
                      <span style="color:#666;  font-size:0.8em;"><strong>Source:</strong> JohnKasich2010, &quot;John Kasich Live Webcast &ndash; August 26th, 2009,&quot; YouTube.com, Sep. 8, 2009</span>
