      <div class="trb_sc" data-role="sc_information sc_container" data-sc-c="page" data-sc-url="/opinion/op-ed/la-oe-defilippis-hughes-gun-myths-debunked-20160708-snap-story.html" data-sc-ti="5 arguments against gun control \xe2\x80\x94 and why they are all wrong" data-sc-th="http://www.trbimg.com/img-57804ac0/turbine/la-oe-defilippis-hughes-gun-myths-debunked-20160708-snap" data-sc-desc="The National Rifle Association and its allies have their post-shooting routine down cold. They wait a day or two and then respond with a blistering array of attacks against gun-safety advocates calling for reform. No matter what the circumstances \xe2\x80\x94 a husband and wife at a Christmas party, a deranged..." data-sc-sl="la-oe-defilippis-hughes-gun-myths-debunked-20160708-snap" data-sc-cont="story" data-sc-nn="Los Angeles Times" data-sc-contid="87786183"><span class="trb_sc_item" data-role="sc_share" data-sc-t="facebook"></span><span class="trb_sc_item" data-role="sc_share" data-sc-t="twitter"></span><span class="trb_sc_item" data-role="sc_email" data-sc-t="email"></span></div>

