                                                              <h1 class="instapaper_title">Ten Arguments Gun Advocates Make, and Why They&#039;re Wrong</h1>


                                <div class="region region-content-header">
    <div id="block-views-meta-block" class="block block-views">


  <div class="block-content content">
    <div class="view view-meta view-id-meta view-display-id-block view-dom-id-35798344168de5b6ebe0c0363f65ce5d">



      <div class="view-content">
        <div class="views-row views-row-1 views-row-odd views-row-first views-row-last">

  <p class="post-author">        <a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/authors/paul-waldman">Paul Waldman</a>  </p>  
          <p class="post-date">December 15, 2012</p>    
          <div class="post-teaser"> <div>Why the latest mass shooting yet again proves gun advocates wrong.</div>
<div>\xc2\xa0</div>
 </div>    
            <div class="share-options"><!-- AddThis Buttons BEGIN --><div class="addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style" addthis:url="http://prospect.org/article/ten-arguments-gun-advocates-make-and-why-theyre-wrong" addthis:title="Ten Arguments Gun Advocates Make, and Why They're Wrong"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/" class="addthis_button_facebook_like addthis_buttons" fb:like:layout="button_count"></a><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/" tw:via="theprospect" class="addthis_button_tweet addthis_buttons"></a><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/" class="addthis_button_pinterest_pinit addthis_buttons">PinIt</a><a class="addthis_counter addthis_pill_style addthis_buttons"></a><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20161021062241/https://www.instapaper.com/hello2?url=http%3A//prospect.org/article/ten-arguments-gun-advocates-make-and-why-theyre-wrong&amp;title=Ten%20Arguments%20Gun%20Advocates%20Make%2C%20and%20Why%20They%27re%20Wrong" class="letter-to-the-editor addthis_buttons">Instapaper</a><a class="addthis_button_readitlater readitlater addthis_buttons" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20161021062241/https://getpocket.com/save?url=http%3A%2F%2Fprospect.org%2Farticle%2Ften-arguments-gun-advocates-make-and-why-theyre-wrong&amp;title=Ten+Arguments+Gun+Advocates+Make%2C+and+Why+They%27re+Wrong">Pocket</a><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20161021062241/https://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php" class="addthis_button_email addthis_buttons">Email</a><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20161021062241/https://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php" class="addthis_button_print addthis_buttons">Print</a></div><!-- AddThis Buttons END --></div>
      </div>
    </div>






</div>  </div>
</div>  </div>
                          </div>
                          <div id="content-header-sidebar">
                  <div class="region region-content-header-sidebar">
    <div id="block-block-36" class="block block-block">


  <div class="block-content content">
    <div style="height:250px;overflow:hidden;"><!-- OpenX body script -->
<script type="text/javascript">
    OX_4ea03cc6b7f8a.showAdUnit("92678");
</script><noscript><iframe id="4ea03cc6b7f8a" name="4ea03cc6b7f8a" src="//web.archive.org/web/20161021062241if_/http://americanprospect-d.openx.net/w/1.0/afr?auid=92678&amp;cb=INSERT_RANDOM_NUMBER_HERE" frameborder="0" framespacing="0" scrolling="no" width="300" height="250"><a href="//web.archive.org/web/20161021062241/http://americanprospect-d.openx.net/w/1.0/rc?cs=4ea03cc6b7f8a&amp;cb=INSERT_RANDOM_NUMBER_HERE"><img src="//web.archive.org/web/20161021062241im_/http://americanprospect-d.openx.net/w/1.0/ai?auid=92678&amp;cs=4ea03cc6b7f8a&amp;cb=INSERT_RANDOM_NUMBER_HERE" border="0" alt=""></a></iframe></noscript></div>  </div>
</div>  </div>
