    <h2 class="block-title">You may also like</h2>

  <div class="block-content content">
    <div class="related_item"><div class="related_item_thumbnail"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/article/koch-brothers%E2%80%99-latest-target-pope-francis"><img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20161021062241im_/http://prospect.org/sites/default/files/styles/square/public/21500409050_e9ae2818fe_o_1.jpg?itok=gR4ZsZaI" width="109" height="109" alt=""/></a></div><div class="related_item_title"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/article/koch-brothers%E2%80%99-latest-target-pope-francis">Koch Brothers\xe2\x80\x99 Latest Target: Pope Francis</a></div><div class="post-author"><div class="field field-name-field-author field-type-node-reference field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/authors/john-gehring">John Gehring</a></div></div></div></div><div class="post-teaser"> <p>Better known for their high-dollar political spending, the billionaire Koch brothers have also poured millions into Catholic University\xe2\x80\x99s business school to promote a free-market orthodoxy sharply at odds with the teachings of Pope Francis.</p>
 </div><div class="related_items_clear"></div></div><div class="related_item"><div class="related_item_thumbnail"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/article/if-2016-campaign-were-satirical-novel"><img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20161021062241im_/http://prospect.org/sites/default/files/styles/square/public/ap_16281028149007_1.jpg?itok=orFiJI-1" width="109" height="109" alt=""/></a></div><div class="related_item_title"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/article/if-2016-campaign-were-satirical-novel">If the 2016 Campaign Were a Satirical Novel</a></div><div class="post-author"><div class="field field-name-field-author field-type-node-reference field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/authors/paul-waldman">Paul Waldman</a></div></div></div></div><div class="post-teaser"> <p>It's almost a bit too on the nose to be a biting caricature of American politics.</p>
 </div><div class="related_items_clear"></div></div><div class="related_item"><div class="related_item_thumbnail"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/article/donald-trumps-surreal-alternate-reality"><img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20161021062241im_/http://prospect.org/sites/default/files/styles/square/public/ap_16290003663731_1.jpg?itok=h3YJkCse" width="109" height="109" alt=""/></a></div><div class="related_item_title"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/article/donald-trumps-surreal-alternate-reality">Donald Trump&#039;s Surreal Alternate Reality</a></div><div class="post-author"><div class="field field-name-field-author field-type-node-reference field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><a href="/web/20161021062241/http://prospect.org/authors/paul-waldman">Paul Waldman</a></div></div></div></div><div class="post-teaser"> <p>Trump's inability to face the truth doesn't just make him a dangerous candidate\xe2\x80\x94it could also be his campaign's undoing.</p>
 </div><div class="related_items_clear"></div></div>  </div>
</div><div id="block-block-67" class="block block-block">


