	<li class="com-block reply1" id="comment_3878771" data-comment-id="comment_3878771" data-user-id="2850" data-comment-timestamp="1374170160">
				<p class="meta"><strong><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160508032850/http://www.webproofreading.com/" rel="nofollow">Gozer the Gozerian</a></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><strong><time datetime="2013-07-18T17:56:00+00:00">7.18.13 @ 1:56PM</time></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><a class="permalink" href="#comment_3878771">#</a></p>

		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>This is one of the issues I use as a litmus test for
distinguishing between general American "liberals" and so-called
"progressives."</p>
<p>Mind you, I call for a pox on both their houses, but the latter
are much, much worse...</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
		<div class="commentactions">

							<button class="comment_reply submit" name="commentparent" value="3878771" style="display:none">reply to this</button>

			<p class="comment_reply_msg login" style="display:none"><a href="//web.archive.org/web/20160508032850/http://reason.com/users/login">log in</a> or <a href="//web.archive.org/web/20160508032850/http://reason.com/users/register">register</a> to reply</p>
