				<p class="meta"><strong>ConstitutionFirst</strong><span class="pipe">|</span><strong><time datetime="2013-07-23T13:16:28+00:00">7.23.13 @ 9:16AM</time></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><a class="permalink" href="#comment_3887753">#</a></p>

		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>You'll feel much better properly armed and trained. :-)</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
		<div class="commentactions">

