	<li class="com-block reply2" id="comment_3878731" data-comment-id="comment_3878731" data-user-id="280" data-comment-timestamp="1374169580">
				<p class="meta"><strong>John</strong><span class="pipe">|</span><strong><time datetime="2013-07-18T17:46:20+00:00">7.18.13 @ 1:46PM</time></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><a class="permalink" href="#comment_3878731">#</a></p>

		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>It was just bad luck that California is falling apart. So the
progs decided to move to Colorado where the luck was a bit
