	<li class="com-block reply4" id="comment_3878776" data-comment-id="comment_3878776" data-user-id="280" data-comment-timestamp="1374170235">
				<p class="meta"><strong>John</strong><span class="pipe">|</span><strong><time datetime="2013-07-18T17:57:15+00:00">7.18.13 @ 1:57PM</time></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><a class="permalink" href="#comment_3878776">#</a></p>

		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>It is really funny to hear twits like Thomas Franks talk about
how the Republicans get people to vote against their economic
interests by distracting voters with social issues. What a case of
projection that is. All Democrats have is social issues. They have
no economic platform much less appeal anymore beyond free shit.
They get people to vote for socialists who will destroy the economy
because the only issues talked about in the election are abortion,
birth control, and racism.</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
		<div class="commentactions">

