		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p><em>They have no economic platform much less appeal anymore
beyond free shit.</em></p>
<p>Yeah they do. Punish the rich. The rich don't pay their fair
share and we know this because they're rich. If they paid their
fair share then they wouldn't be rich, now would they?<br/>
Taxes are not just a means to give away free shit. They're
punishment for being rich.<br/>
They've got an economic policy alright. It's called envy.</p>		</div>
