		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>"Redistribution of wealth" isn't an economic platform?<br/>
"Social justice" isn't an economic platform?<br/>
"Social democracy"? Socialism? "From each according to his
ability..."?</p>
<p>(Not that there's anything right about that...)</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
