		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>Bad economic advice is still economic advice.</p>
<p>What they <em>care</em> about is power, wealth (but I repeat
myself), influence (but I repeat myself), status, etc. However,
their personal concerns and their platform are quite different
things...</p>		</div>
