		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>I guess I'll just have to risk it. My only stopping options are
MD (too close to home to need a stop), DE (all 5 miles of it), NJ
and NY (too close to my destination to bother).</p>
<p>I suppose I could do the whole 8 hours without stopping, but the
dog wouldn't appreciate that too much.</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
