			<!--Comment Head-->
	<li class="com-block reply4" id="comment_3878884" data-comment-id="comment_3878884" data-user-id="280" data-comment-timestamp="1374171816">
				<p class="meta"><strong>John</strong><span class="pipe">|</span><strong><time datetime="2013-07-18T18:23:36+00:00">7.18.13 @ 2:23PM</time></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><a class="permalink" href="#comment_3878884">#</a></p>

		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>Kristen,</p>
<p>Take the Poconos root and drive up I-81. And then cut across to
get to Connecticut and up to Vermont. DO NOT drive through New
Jersey and avoid New York as much as possible. It is not worth the
risk.</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
