		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>Unfortunately I'm staying just south of the Champlain Bridge on
the lake, making any route but 95-GSP-NYS Thruway un-doable. If I
were headed to Burlington or Stowe, I might consider 84-684-91, but
not this time.</p>		</div>
