	<li class="com-block reply0" id="comment_3878791" data-comment-id="comment_3878791" data-user-id="388" data-comment-timestamp="1374170466">
				<p class="meta"><strong>Live Free or Diet</strong><span class="pipe">|</span><strong><time datetime="2013-07-18T18:01:06+00:00">7.18.13 @ 2:01PM</time></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><a class="permalink" href="#comment_3878791">#</a></p>

		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>I've been carrying a gun for 30 years and it hasn't shot someone
yet. I was even robbed during that time. The cops came and
collected him off the floor of the shop, un-shot.<br/>
Yet people claim because I carry a gun, I can't wait to shoot
someone?</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
		<div class="commentactions">

							<button class="comment_reply submit" name="commentparent" value="3878791" style="display:none">reply to this</button>

			<p class="comment_reply_msg login" style="display:none"><a href="//web.archive.org/web/20160508032850/http://reason.com/users/login">log in</a> or <a href="//web.archive.org/web/20160508032850/http://reason.com/users/register">register</a> to reply</p>
		</div>
			</li>



			<!--Comment Head-->
	<li class="com-block reply1" id="comment_3878808" data-comment-id="comment_3878808" data-user-id="1054" data-comment-timestamp="1374170719">
				<p class="meta"><strong>sarcasmic</strong><span class="pipe">|</span><strong><time datetime="2013-07-18T18:05:19+00:00">7.18.13 @ 2:05PM</time></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><a class="permalink" href="#comment_3878808">#</a></p>

		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>The people who claim that are slaves to their emotions. If they
had a gun then they would kill someone the very first time they got
into an argument, got cut off on the road, got the wrong order at a
restaurant, or anything else.</p>
<p>So they project their own failings onto everyone else. Well, not
everyone. Everyone except people in government. They're
special.</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
		<div class="commentactions">

							<button class="comment_reply submit" name="commentparent" value="3878808" style="display:none">reply to this</button>

