		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>"Yet people claim because I carry a gun, I can't wait to shoot
someone?"</p>
<p>A lot of people claim a lot of things. Your statement is
irrelevant.</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
