		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p><em>Compromise requires that both parties relinquish something.
If your counterpart\xe2\x80\x99s position is \xe2\x80\x9cgive me this now, and I\xe2\x80\x99ll take
the rest later,\xe2\x80\x9d there is no real compromise to be had. Over
decades, that has been precisely the experience of <strike>American
