		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>As Jefferson said so eloquently:</p>
<p>"Experience hath shewn, that even under the best forms of
government those entrusted with power have, in time, and by slow
operations, perverted it into tyranny."</p>
<p>Which is why he helped create our democracy, which allows us to
peacefully change our government. If you love Jefferson so much
quit whining about our system of government.</p>		</div>
