	<li class="com-block reply3" id="comment_3884101" data-comment-id="comment_3884101" data-user-id="18629" data-comment-timestamp="1374419629">
				<p class="meta"><strong>Ronald Reagan</strong><span class="pipe">|</span><strong><time datetime="2013-07-21T15:13:49+00:00">7.21.13 @ 11:13AM</time></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><a class="permalink" href="#comment_3884101">#</a></p>

		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>Sure. Just quit whining about our government. The system the
founders set up is working. "The people" have the opportunity to
over throw our government every four years. The fact is "the
people" have chosen. Your views lost.</p>
<p>A more coherent argument and less name calling will make you
more persuasive.</p>		</div>
		<!--Comment actions (Reply/Login/Register)-->
