	<li class="com-block reply2" id="comment_3919017" data-comment-id="comment_3919017" data-user-id="11998" data-comment-timestamp="1375746332">
				<p class="meta"><strong>Irish</strong><span class="pipe">|</span><strong><time datetime="2013-08-05T23:45:32+00:00">8.5.13 @ 7:45PM</time></strong><span class="pipe">|</span><a class="permalink" href="#comment_3919017">#</a></p>

		<!--Comment Body-->
				<div class="content">
			<p>Hilarious. Guy posts comment a day after this article is no
