<li class="email-share"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160421021353/mailto:/?subject=From%20newyorker.com:%20Six%20Snowballs%20Thrown%20in%20the%20Gun-Control%20Debate&amp;body=Six%20Snowballs%20Thrown%20in%20the%20Gun-Control%20Debate%0Ahttp%3A%2F%2Fwww.newyorker.com%2Fnews%2Fdaily-comment%2Fsix-snowballs-thrown-in-the-gun-control-debate-gopnik" data-template="mailto:?subject=From%20newyorker.com:%20{{{escaped_text}}}&amp;body={{{escaped_text}}}%0A{{{escaped_url}}}" title="Email" class="email-share-btn"><span></span></a></li>
