                                                        <header class="entry-header">
                                                            <h2 class="entry-title">                                               
                                                                <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160622140159/http://thefederalist.com/2016/06/21/4-major-problems-with-gun-control-arguments/" title="4 Major Problems With Gun Control Arguments">4 Major Problems With Gun Control Arguments</a>
                                                            </h2><!-- .entry-title -->
                                                            <div class="subtitle">Gun control proponents are full of hypocrisy, don\xe2\x80\x99t tailor their demands to reality, misapply blame, and use law to discriminate.</div>
                                                            <div class="rwd-byline">By <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160622140159/http://thefederalist.com/author/dustinmurphy/" title="Posts by Dustin Murphy" rel="author">Dustin Murphy</a></div>
