        <h1 class="article-title">4 Pro-Gun Arguments We&#039;re Sick of Hearing</h1>         <h2 class="article-sub-title">Thursday&#039;s mass shooting is sure to be met with the usual arguments for why we can&#039;t do anything about gun control</h2>
        <div class="article-contributor">
                            <div class="author-block">
                                    </div>
                <span class="author">By <a href="/web/20160510040654/http://www.rollingstone.com/contributor/amanda-marcotte" rel="author" data-track data-track-action="Tap Byline" data-track-label="/contributor/amanda-marcotte">Amanda Marcotte</a></span>
