                        <li class="email">
            <a class="rs-icon-mail-alt" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160510040654/mailto:\xc2\xa0?subject=Check this out on Rolling Stone!&amp;body=Hey, I saw this on Rolling Stone and thought you\xe2\x80\x99d be interested in it.%0D%0A%0D%0Ahttp://www.rollingstone.com/politics/news/4-pro-gun-arguments-were-sick-of-hearing-20151001" data-track data-track-label="Share - Email">
