<li eza="cwidth:545px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:87px;wocalc:87px;hcalc:285px;rend_px_area:20710;" cwidth="545" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[1]/ol/li[1];pagepos:80;cwidth:545px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:87px;wocalc:87px;hcalc:285;rend_px_area:20710;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:103;req_px_area:21745.5;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Most violent crimes are committed with guns; thus, restricting gun ownership will likely reduce the number of such crimes.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:545px;;cheight:57px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:94px;wocalc:94px;hcalc:304px;rend_px_area:31065;" cwidth="545" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[1]/ol/li[2];pagepos:81;cwidth:545px;cheight:57px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:94px;wocalc:94px;hcalc:304;rend_px_area:31065;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:103;req_px_area:32618.25;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Lunatics, bullied school kids, disgruntled workers, and others can inflict mass casualties with guns that otherwise wouldn't be possible.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:545px;;cheight:57px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:80px;wocalc:80px;hcalc:323px;rend_px_area:31065;" cwidth="545" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[1]/ol/li[3];pagepos:82;cwidth:545px;cheight:57px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:80px;wocalc:80px;hcalc:323;rend_px_area:31065;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:122;req_px_area:32448;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">A crime victim who has a gun may be in more danger than an unarmed person since the criminal may kill in perceived self-defense.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:545px;;cheight:57px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:100px;wocalc:100px;hcalc:266px;rend_px_area:31065;" cwidth="545" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[1]/ol/li[4];pagepos:83;cwidth:545px;cheight:57px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:100px;wocalc:100px;hcalc:266;rend_px_area:31065;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:122;req_px_area:32618.25;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Suicides and crimes of passion are higher with gun availability, as it's much easier to act immediately on your impulses when a gun is available.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:545px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:101px;wocalc:101px;hcalc:228px;rend_px_area:20710;" cwidth="545" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[1]/ol/li[5];pagepos:84;cwidth:545px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:101px;wocalc:101px;hcalc:228;rend_px_area:20710;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:112;req_px_area:21745.5;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">The 2nd Amendment of the Constitution was targeted towards militia, e.g. the National Guard, rather than individuals.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:545px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:86px;wocalc:86px;hcalc:209px;rend_px_area:20710;" cwidth="545" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[1]/ol/li[6];pagepos:85;cwidth:545px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:86px;wocalc:86px;hcalc:209;rend_px_area:20710;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:84;req_px_area:21465.6;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Crimes that may have been less harmful can be made more dangerous by adding a gun.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:545px;;cheight:57px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:87px;wocalc:87px;hcalc:304px;rend_px_area:31065;" cwidth="545" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[1]/ol/li[7];pagepos:86;cwidth:545px;cheight:57px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:87px;wocalc:87px;hcalc:304;rend_px_area:31065;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:103;req_px_area:32618.25;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Legalized gun ownership means guns have a greater chance of falling into the hands of kids, potentially resulting in some deadly accidents.
