<li eza="cwidth:544px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:79px;wocalc:79px;hcalc:323px;rend_px_area:20672;" cwidth="544" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[2]/ol/li[1];pagepos:90;cwidth:544px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:79px;wocalc:79px;hcalc:323;rend_px_area:20672;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:103;req_px_area:21705.6;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Criminals will always find a way to obtain their guns, leaving law-abiding citizens without any weapons to use in defense.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:544px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:93px;wocalc:93px;hcalc:209px;rend_px_area:20672;" cwidth="544" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[2]/ol/li[2];pagepos:91;cwidth:544px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:93px;wocalc:93px;hcalc:209;rend_px_area:20672;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:103;req_px_area:21705.6;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Crimes are often prevented by the deterrent effect of the possibility of victim gun possession. 
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:544px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:101px;wocalc:101px;hcalc:152px;rend_px_area:20672;" cwidth="544" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[2]/ol/li[3];pagepos:92;cwidth:544px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:101px;wocalc:101px;hcalc:152;rend_px_area:20672;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:112;req_px_area:21705.6;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">The 2nd Amendment to the Constitution protects the individual's right to gun ownership.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:544px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:89px;wocalc:89px;hcalc:266px;rend_px_area:20672;" cwidth="544" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[2]/ol/li[4];pagepos:93;cwidth:544px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:89px;wocalc:89px;hcalc:266;rend_px_area:20672;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:112;req_px_area:21705.6;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Woman and weaker individuals may have no means of self-defense from rape or other crimes, especially in the inner city.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:544px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:98px;wocalc:98px;hcalc:171px;rend_px_area:20672;" cwidth="544" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[2]/ol/li[5];pagepos:94;cwidth:544px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:98px;wocalc:98px;hcalc:171;rend_px_area:20672;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:94;req_px_area:21705.6;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Guns in the possession of citizens are an added protection against government tyranny.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:544px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:110px;wocalc:110px;hcalc:133px;rend_px_area:20672;" cwidth="544" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[2]/ol/li[6];pagepos:95;cwidth:544px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:110px;wocalc:110px;hcalc:133;rend_px_area:20672;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:103;req_px_area:20592;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Police are often too overwhelmed to protect all citizens from violent crime.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:544px;;cheight:57px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:87px;wocalc:87px;hcalc:285px;rend_px_area:31008;" cwidth="544" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[2]/ol/li[7];pagepos:96;cwidth:544px;cheight:57px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:87px;wocalc:87px;hcalc:285;rend_px_area:31008;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:103;req_px_area:32558.4;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Banning guns will create another potentially large source of organized criminal revenue, as a black market for guns will surely develop.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:544px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:125px;wocalc:125px;hcalc:171px;rend_px_area:20672;" cwidth="544" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[2]/ol/li[8];pagepos:97;cwidth:544px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:125px;wocalc:125px;hcalc:171;rend_px_area:20672;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:150;req_px_area:21705.6;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Banning guns will take away yet another piece of our liberty, which is one more step to socialism and totalitarianism.
    		</li>
<li eza="cwidth:544px;;cheight:38px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:105px;wocalc:105px;hcalc:171px;rend_px_area:20672;" cwidth="544" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/table/tr[2]/td[2]/ol/li[9];pagepos:98;cwidth:544px;cheight:38px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:105px;wocalc:105px;hcalc:171;rend_px_area:20672;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;minimum_margins:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:1;ez_min_text_wdth:112;req_px_area:21705.6;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Reasonable gun control &amp; education steps can be put in place, so an outright ban is unnecessary.
    	</li>
