				<div class="posted-by">By <a href="/web/20160820181724/http://www.latinpost.com/reporters/shawn-raymundo">Shawn Raymundo</a> (<a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160820181724/mailto:staff@latinpost.com">staff@latinpost.com</a>)</div>
				<div class="posted-time">First Posted: May 29, 2014 04:55 PM EDT </div><span class="clearfix"></span>
